      <title>追逐毛绒先知：AI玩具如何成为情感资本的新边疆</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20250815194005924-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 15 Aug 2025 19:40:05 +0800</pubDate>
